//     macLen {64, 88, 128}), 8 AFT each -> sub-sample [first, middle, last]
//     (81 gen vectors total).
//   - 27 "ver" testGroups, 20 AFT each with 15 pass + 5 fail -> take 2 pass
//     + 2 fail per group (108 ver vectors total).
